    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6508" root="جنى" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَانٍ</span></b>  <i>A gatherer</i> of fruit [&amp;c.]: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and also (assumed tropical:)  <i>A
committer of a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِنَايَة</span> [or <i>crime,</i> &amp;c.]: (K, * TA:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُنَاةٌ</span> (S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُنَّآءٌ</span> (Sb, K) and [of pauc.]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْنَآءٌ</span>, which last is extr., (S, K,) or doubtful.
(S.) Hence the prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْنَاؤُهَا أَبْنَاؤُهَا</span>, explained
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بنى</span>. (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Hence also,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الجَانِى</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>The
wolf.</i> (IAar, TA voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَابٍ</span>, q. v.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>i. q.</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَقَّاحٌ</span>; (IAar, Az, TA;) i. e. <i>A fecundater of
palm-trees.</i> (Az, TA.)

